The custom price reader derives from PaddlePaddle PP-OCRv6_medium_rec,
distributed under Apache License 2.0. Source/model provenance and notices are
preserved under parseq_ocr/_vendor/ppocr/. Its training-only auxiliary decoder
uses the PARSeq code and initialization identified above. Model weights are
downloaded separately and are not included in the source release.

The opt-in WATERec GPU preprocessing includes a coefficient algorithm adapted
from Pillow's libImaging/Resample.c and fixed-point CUDA resize/packing helpers.
Pillow/PIL copyright and MIT-CMU license terms are preserved in
parseq_ocr/_native/waterec/PILLOW_LICENSE. The coefficient C library and CUDA
kernels compile locally; no compiled preprocessing binaries are bundled.
